  "title": "Ellington Credit Declares Monthly Common Distribution",
  "summary": "OLD GREENWICH, Conn. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Apr. 7, 2026-- Ellington Credit Company (NYSE: EARN) (\"we\" or the \"Fund\") today announced that its Board of Trustees has declared a monthly common dividend of $0.08 per share, payable on May 29, 2026 to common shareholders of record as of April 30, 2026.",
